{"id":"design-design","cat":"design","title":"常见系统设计题","file":"design/design.md","authors":["csview-local 示例"],"type":"qa","questions":[{"id":"design-design~1","n":1,"title":"设计一个秒杀系统","doc":"design-design","cat":"design","badges":[{"kind":"key","text":"重要"}],"leetcode":null,"words":545,"html":"<p>秒杀的本质矛盾是<strong>瞬时百万请求 vs 库存只有几百</strong>，所以整体思路是「<strong>层层过滤，把流量在到达数据库之前削掉 99.99%</strong>」。</p>\n<p>从上到下五层：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>前端</strong>：按钮置灰防重复点击，答题 / 验证码打散请求时间，静态资源全部 CDN。</li>\n<li><strong>接入层</strong>：Nginx / 网关按用户和 IP 限流，同一用户 N 秒内只放行一次；活动未开始直接拒绝。</li>\n<li><strong>应用层</strong>：库存预热到 Redis，用 Lua 原子扣减；扣减成功才生成订单消息投进 MQ，失败立即返回「已售罄」并<strong>打上售罄标记</strong>，后续请求在本地内存就短路掉。</li>\n<li><strong>异步层</strong>：MQ 削峰，订单服务按数据库能承受的速度消费落库。</li>\n<li><strong>数据层</strong>：库存扣减用 <code>update ... set stock = stock - 1 where id = ? and stock &gt; 0</code>，靠行锁 + 条件保证不超卖，作为最后兜底。</li>\n</ol>\n<p>库存扣减的 Lua 骨架：</p>\n<figure class=\"codeblock\" data-lang=\"sql\"><figcaption class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"cb-lang\">SQL</span><span class=\"cb-meta\">7 行</span><button class=\"cb-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy aria-label=\"复制代码\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8\"/></svg><span>复制</span></button></figcaption><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light night-owl\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">-- 语义示意：Redis Lua，判断与扣减必须原子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">local</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> stock </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> tonumber(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">redis</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">call</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">GET</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, KEYS[1]))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> stock </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">==</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> nil </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">or</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> stock </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">&#x3C;=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> then</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\"> -</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> redis</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">call</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">SISMEMBER</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, KEYS[2], ARGV[1]) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">==</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> then</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\"> -</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\">2</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> end</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">  -- 已购</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">redis</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">call</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">DECR</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, KEYS[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">redis</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">call</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">SADD</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, KEYS[2], ARGV[1])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 1</span></span></code></pre></figure><div class=\"adm adm-warning\"><div class=\"adm-head\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M10.3 3.9 2.6 17.2A2 2 0 0 0 4.3 20h15.4a2 2 0 0 0 1.7-2.8L13.7 3.9a2 2 0 0 0-3.4 0Z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4M12 16.6v.4\"/></svg><span>三个必须回答的追问</span></div><div class=\"adm-body\"><ul>\n<li><strong>超卖</strong>：Redis 扣减成功但落库失败怎么办？要有对账与库存回补，且 DB 层仍带 <code>stock &gt; 0</code> 条件。</li>\n<li><strong>少卖</strong>：用户下单不付款，库存要能超时释放，用延迟消息回滚。</li>\n<li><strong>热点 key</strong>：单个库存 key 会把一个 Redis 分片打满，需要库存分桶（把 100 拆成 10 份各 10）分散压力。</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div>","toc":[],"freq":4},{"id":"design-design~2","n":2,"title":"设计一个分布式限流器","doc":"design-design","cat":"design","badges":[{"kind":"key","text":"重要"}],"leetcode":null,"words":346,"html":"<p>先区分四种算法的取舍：</p>\n<div class=\"table-wrap\"><table><thead>\n<tr>\n<th>算法</th>\n<th>允许突发</th>\n<th>实现复杂度</th>\n<th>说明</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td>固定窗口计数</td>\n<td>边界处 2 倍</td>\n<td>最低</td>\n<td>简单但有临界突刺</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口日志</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>精确，但要存每次请求时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>滑动窗口计数</td>\n<td>少量</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>按小格子加权，工程折中</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>令牌桶</td>\n<td><strong>是</strong></td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>匀速发牌，桶容量决定突发上限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>漏桶</td>\n<td>否</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>强制恒定速率流出</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table></div><p>分布式场景把状态放 Redis，用 Lua 保证「取状态 + 算补充 + 扣减」原子。令牌桶只需要存 <code>tokens</code> 和 <code>last_refill_ts</code> 两个字段，按时间差惰性补牌，不需要定时任务：</p>\n<figure class=\"codeblock\" data-lang=\"sql\"><figcaption class=\"cb-bar\"><span class=\"cb-lang\">SQL</span><span class=\"cb-meta\">7 行</span><button class=\"cb-copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy aria-label=\"复制代码\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><rect x=\"9\" y=\"9\" width=\"11\" height=\"11\" rx=\"2\"/><path d=\"M5 15V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8\"/></svg><span>复制</span></button></figcaption><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light night-owl\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#d6deeb;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#011627\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#6A737D;--shiki-light-font-style:inherit;--shiki-dark:#637777;--shiki-dark-font-style:italic\">-- 语义示意：令牌桶惰性补牌</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">local</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> tokens </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> tonumber(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">redis</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">call</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">HGET</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, KEYS[1], </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">tokens</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">)) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">or</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> capacity</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">local</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> last</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">   =</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> tonumber(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">redis</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">call</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">HGET</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, KEYS[1], </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">ts</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">)) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">or</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> now</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">tokens </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">=</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\"> math</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">min</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(capacity, tokens </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">+</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> (</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">now</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\"> -</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> last</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">) </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">*</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> rate)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">if</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\"> tokens </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> then</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 0</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\"> end</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">redis</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#82AAFF\">call</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">(</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">HMSET</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, KEYS[1], </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">tokens</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, tokens </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#7FDBCA\">-</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 1</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#ECC48D\">ts</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#D9F5DD\">'</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">, </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">now</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#D6DEEB\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#C792EA\">return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#F78C6C\"> 1</span></span></code></pre></figure><div class=\"adm adm-tip\"><div class=\"adm-head\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M12 3v3M12 18v3M3 12h3M18 12h3M5.6 5.6l2.1 2.1M16.3 16.3l2.1 2.1M18.4 5.6l-2.1 2.1M7.7 16.3l-2.1 2.1\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3.2\"/></svg><span>怎么选</span></div><div class=\"adm-body\"><p>对外 API 网关一般用令牌桶，因为要容忍客户端的正常突发；对下游数据库或第三方接口的保护用漏桶，因为对方要的是平稳速率。<strong>单机限流 + 分布式限流两级并存</strong>，本地先挡掉大部分，减少 Redis 压力。</p>\n</div></div>","toc":[],"freq":3},{"id":"design-design~3","n":3,"title":"设计一个短链系统","doc":"design-design","cat":"design","badges":[{"kind":"master","text":"掌握"}],"leetcode":null,"words":450,"html":"<p>核心是把长 URL 映射成 6~8 位短码，并保证<strong>发号不冲突、跳转足够快</strong>。</p>\n<p><strong>发号</strong>方案对比：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>哈希取前 N 位</strong>：实现简单但会碰撞，需要处理冲突重试。</li>\n<li><strong>自增 ID 转 62 进制</strong>：天然无冲突，6 位 62 进制可表示 568 亿。分布式下用号段模式（每次从发号器取 1000 个号缓存在本地）或雪花算法，避免每次请求都访问中心节点。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>存储</strong>用 KV：<code>shortCode → longUrl</code>，读多写少，Redis 缓存热点短码，MySQL 做持久化。</p>\n<p><strong>跳转用 301 还是 302</strong>？301 永久重定向会被浏览器缓存，后续不再经过你的服务，省流量但<strong>统计不到点击</strong>；302 每次都回源，能做点击统计和风控。商业短链基本都选 302。</p>\n<div class=\"adm adm-info\"><div class=\"adm-head\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.8\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"9\"/><path d=\"M12 11v5M12 7.6v.6\"/></svg><span>容易被追问的点</span></div><div class=\"adm-body\"><ul>\n<li>同一个长 URL 要不要复用短码？复用省空间，但无法区分渠道来源，通常按「长 URL + 渠道」做唯一键。</li>\n<li>怎么防恶意刷？发号接口限流 + 长 URL 黑名单 + 目标站点安全检测。</li>\n<li>过期清理？给短码设 TTL，冷数据归档，避免主表无限膨胀。</li>\n</ul>\n</div></div>","toc":[],"freq":2}],"words":1341,"intro":""}